        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of running your very own convenience store! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Convenience Store Simulator, you take on the role of a store manager, managing inventory, serving customers, and expanding your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy realistic gameplay with detailed store customization, daily challenges, and a variety of products to stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're fulfilling customer requests or upgrading your store, this game offers a fun and engaging simulation experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of casual management games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Controls&gt; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD keys: Move left/right/up/down </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB key: Inventory </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC key: Menu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E key: Pick up/throw items/talk to other characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q key: Toggle UI On/Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space key: Jump </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left shift key: Dash </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Move camera </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click mouse: Place item </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click mouse: Return item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of running your very own convenience store! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Convenience Store Simulator, you take on the role of a store manager, managing inventory, serving customers, and expanding your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy realistic gameplay with detailed store customization, daily challenges, and a variety of products to stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're fulfilling customer requests or upgrading your store, this game offers a fun and engaging simulation experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of casual management games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Controls&gt; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD keys: Move left/right/up/down </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB key: Inventory </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC key: Menu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E key: Pick up/throw items/talk to other characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q key: Toggle UI On/Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space key: Jump </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left shift key: Dash </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Move camera </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click mouse: Place item </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click mouse: Return item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
